  "notes": "Active skill pack targets graphcompose-1.7.x (verified against 1.7.0 from Maven Central: io.github.demchaav:graph-compose:1.7.0). v1.7.0 is additive over 1.6.x (zero breaking changes), so the pack is a port of graphcompose-1.6 plus the new 1.7 primitives (inline shape runs, polygon geometry, composite inline figures + checkboxes, swappable tick/arrow styles, softPanel stroke overloads, per-corner radius, vertical text alignment, JetBrains Mono, dashed/dotted lines, semantic timelines, availableHeight(), headingBar(...)) and the nested-stack position() fix. The frozen graphcompose-1.6 snapshot is retained on disk under versions/graphcompose-1.6/ so a project that pins back to 1.6.x still resolves a version-accurate pack; pre-1.6.7 pins remain resolvable via JitPack as com.github.DemchaAV:GraphCompose:vX.Y.Z. All skills remain needs-validation until the full render, preview, and visual-diff loop passes against 1.7.0."
